    "explanation" : "### [multiple-imports](https://github.com/sleekbyte/tailor/issues/66)\nMultiple `import` statements should not be defined on a single line.\n\n*Preferred*\n\n```\nimport Foundation\nimport Cocoa\n```\n\n*Not Preferred*\n\n```\nimport Foundation; import Cocoa\n```",
