  {
    "id" : "operator-whitespace",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Whitespace Surrounding Operators",
    "description" : "Ensures that operator declarations have exactly one space surrounding the operator symbol.",
    "explanation" : "### [operator-whitespace](https://github.com/sleekbyte/tailor/issues/89)\n\nPrefer single space around operator in operator declarations.\n\n*Preferred*\n\n```\ninfix operator -+* { precedence 70 associativity right }\n```\n\n*Not Preferred*\n\n```\ninfix operator-+* { precedence 70 associativity right }\n\ninfix operator -+*  { precedence 70 associativity right }\n\ninfix operator -+*{ precedence 70 associativity right }\n\ninfix operator  -+* { precedence 70 associativity right }\n```",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 2,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
